VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeIntro::
    .string "So, you made it back, kid!\p"
    .string "I'm LT. SURGE.\n"
    .string "VERMILION CITY's GYM LEADER.\p"
    .string "You handled VOLT TACKLE training\n"
    .string "without flinching.\p"
    .string "That takes nerve!\p"
    .string "Power isn't handed to you.\n"
    .string "You train until you can hold it!\p"
    .string "But a GYM battle is combat!\n"
    .string "No holding back!\p"
    .string "I tell you, kid, electric POKéMON\n"
    .string "saved me during the war!\p"
    .string "Now show me you can stand against\n"
    .string "real voltage!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgePostBattle::
    .string "A little word of advice, kid!\p"
    .string "Electricity is sure powerful!\p"
    .string "But training is how you make\n"
    .string "that power obey!\p"
    .string "But, it's useless against GROUND-\n"
    .string "type POKéMON!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "The THUNDERBADGE proves you\n"
    .string "cleared VERMILION GYM!\p"
    .string "And with it, take this pass.\n"
    .string "It'll get you special MART stock.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedThunderPassFromLtSurge::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the THUNDER PASS\n"
    .string "from LT. SURGE.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainThunderBadge::
    .string "That pass unlocks vitamins and\n"
    .string "battle items at POKéMON MARTS.\p"
    .string "Power isn't handed to you.\n"
    .string "Use those tools and train until\l"
    .string "your POKéMON can hold it.\p"
    .string "Bring me a RAICHU with real\n"
    .string "voltage.\p"
    .string "Then I'll show you evolution\n"
    .string "through serious output.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeOfferElectabuzzTrade::
    .string "Hey, kid!\p"
    .string "You've got a RAICHU with real\n"
    .string "voltage, right?\p"
    .string "I've got an ELECTABUZZ holding\n"
    .string "an ELECTIRIZER.\p"
    .string "Trade me your RAICHU for it?$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeDeclineElectabuzzTrade::
    .string "No pressure, kid!\p"
    .string "Come back when you're ready to\n"
    .string "handle that kind of power.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeNotRaichu::
    .string "That's not RAICHU, kid!\p"
    .string "Bring me the real lightning rod.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeElectabuzzTradeComplete::
    .string "Hah!\n"
    .string "Now that's a power surge!\p"
    .string "That ELECTIRIZER ought to wake up\n"
    .string "something fierce in ELECTABUZZ.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeElectabuzzTradeDone::
    .string "That ELECTABUZZ was built for\n"
    .string "serious output.\p"
    .string "Keep it charged, kid!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_UnusedSurgeReward::
    .string "{PLAYER} received something\n"
    .string "from LT. SURGE.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainShockWave::
    .string "SHOCK WAVE is an ELECTRIC move!\p"
    .string "Teach it to an ELECTRIC POKéMON!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_MakeRoomInYourBag::
    .string "Yo, kid, make room in your BAG!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeDefeat::
    .string "Now that's a shocker!\p"
    .string "You're the real deal, kid!\p"
    .string "Fine, then, take the THUNDERBADGE!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerIntro::
    .string "When I was in the Army, LT. SURGE\n"
    .string "was my strict CO.\p"
    .string "He was a hard taskmaster.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerDefeat::
    .string "Stop!\n"
    .string "You're very good!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerPostBattle::
    .string "It's not easy opening that door.\p"
    .string "LT. SURGE was always famous for\n"
    .string "his cautious nature in the Army.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyIntro::
    .string "I'm a lightweight, but I'm good\n"
    .string "with electricity!\p"
    .string "That's why I joined this GYM.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyDefeat::
    .string "Fried!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyPostBattle::
    .string "Okay, I'll talk!\p"
    .string "LT. SURGE said he hid door\n"
    .string "switches inside something.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwayneIntro::
    .string "This is no place for kids!\n"
    .string "Not even if you're good!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwayneDefeat::
    .string "Wow!\n"
    .string "Surprised me!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwaynePostBattle::
    .string "LT. SURGE installed the traps in\n"
    .string "the GYM himself.\p"
    .string "He set up double locks everywhere.\n"
    .string "Let me give you a hint.\p"
    .string "When you open the first lock, the\n"
    .string "second lock is right next to it.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "LT. SURGE has a nickname.\p"
    .string "People refer to him as the\n"
    .string "Lightning Unovan!\p"
    .string "He's an expert on electric\n"
    .string "POKéMON.\p"
    .string "FLYING/WATER-type POKéMON match\n"
    .string "poorly against the ELECTRIC type.\p"
    .string "Beware of paralysis, too.\p"
    .string "LT. SURGE is very cautious.\p"
    .string "He's locked himself in, so it won't\n"
    .string "be easy getting to him.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuySurgeReturned::
    .string "Ah, LT. SURGE is back from\n"
    .string "DIGLETT'S CAVE!\p"
    .string "Sounds like he put you through\n"
    .string "some serious training.\p"
    .string "Want some advice before you\n"
    .string "challenge him?$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyLetsGetCharged::
    .string "All right!\n"
    .string "Let's get charged up!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyShowSurge::
    .string "All right!\p"
    .string "Then go show LT. SURGE what you\n"
    .string "learned in DIGLETT'S CAVE!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuySurgeAway::
    .string "Hold it, kid!\p"
    .string "LT. SURGE is away from the GYM.\n"
    .string "He's training in DIGLETT'S CAVE.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuySurgeStillAway::
    .string "LT. SURGE is still away from the\n"
    .string "GYM.\p"
    .string "Try looking in DIGLETT'S CAVE.$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "Whew!\n"
    .string "That match was electric!$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "VERMILION POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: LT. SURGE\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "VERMILION POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: LT. SURGE\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"
